{"id":"5200c72d06d4734b","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability.md","title":"Bounded Stabilization of a Single-Letter Trace","display":"lem-single-letter-trace-stability — Bounded Stabilization of a Single-Letter Trace","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability","aliases":["89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-single-letter-trace-stability — Bounded Stabilization of a Single-Letter Trace","depends_on":["[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","[[89-df-modal-degree]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-single-letter-trace-stability — Bounded Stabilization of a Single-Letter Trace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" href=\"?note=4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" title=\"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace\">89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅含字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=b_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(n=b_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A\">\\(t_A\\)</span> 是 A-trace 的双递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是实际语法子公式集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\exists r\\le n\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n\\forall k\\ge r\\;(t_A(B,k)=t_A(B,r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\exists r\\le n\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n\\forall k\\ge r\\;(t_A(B,k)=t_A(B,r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 109–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>每个不同盒子公式的列在秩 0 为 1，此后只可能从 1 变为 0 一次，因为每行是此前全部内式值的积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个相邻行区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\to1,\\ldots,n\\to n+1\">\\(0\\to1,\\ldots,n\\to n+1\\)</span> 中必有一个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\to r+1\">\\(r\\to r+1\\)</span> 没有盒列改变，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个盒列要改变至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 次。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是这些盒的布尔组合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 列与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 列也保持，因而全部子公式列保持。\n若两相邻行所有子公式相同，再下一行每个盒列增加的内式值与刚检查的值相同，所以盒列仍保持；布尔列和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 列随后保持。归纳得到所有后续行相同。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\le n\">\\(r\\le n\\)</span>，尾部从秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 起已稳定，足够计算前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 行。本界是原书 Lemma 3 证明中得到的更精确稳定行界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4c9feb1083d7b4dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"n=b_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"t_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\exists r\\le n\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n\\forall k\\ge r\\;(t_A(B,k)=t_A(B,r)).","display":true},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"0\\to1,\\ldots,n\\to n+1","display":false},{"tex":"r\\to r+1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"r\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1690,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"单字母构造：[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics]] → [[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c9feb1083d7b4dd","04ea1c6ff126f884"]}